Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 18:27:17 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1161/1178] HERESY 1167: Engine's Artwork card (the painter: by
 the cards, Krea 2 Muse Q4 or Q8, SDXL), the painters credited, the jazz
 chords gone
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 05.10.2026: «Переключатель квантов Q8 / Q4 оформишь в Engine? Изначальным выставь Q4»; «Кредит не забудь автору»;
«К хуям убери "джазовые аккорды" из "моей партитуры" в Творце. Это никому не нужно».
· Engine → Artwork, under the Writer (Appearance beside both): who paints a take's artwork: by the cards (Krea 2 Muse Q4
  from 16 GB, else SDXL: the lab decides), Krea 2 Muse Q4, Q8, or SDXL, each with its room and its time; this browser's
  choice (yue2.artPainter, mirrored to the settings file, where the lab and the API read it); every draw asks for it.
  Krea 2 Muse by Stable Yogi and Krea 2 credited there and in About (with CyberRealistic XL by Cyberdelia).
· the draw's toast and the menu's hint: «a minute or two» (Krea with its prompter and its critic), not half a minute.
· the score's examples: the jazz chords chip and example gone.
The console test: Engine's rows with the Artwork card, the examples without the jazz. 19 keys in the six catalogs.
cdp-console 334/0/7, check-i18n 14/0, check-player 3/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
